steps.message:
The prepared CSS and docs strongly suggest a missing `MagicLink` value object rather than a database record. I’m going to implement the documented sign-in contract first with a reusable concern:

- a stateless, signed, 15-minute token containing the identity and bcrypt digest;
- an HttpOnly `pending_authentication_token` cookie;
- `POST /session/magic_link` accepting `code`;
- a multipart email whose subject contains the code;
- a shared code-entry partial using `autocomplete="one-time-code"`.

Before editing, I’ll inspect SaaS signup overrides and test naming conventions so the shared screen remains compatible, then create the model/controller tests alongside production changes.

